  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Netherlands Court of Audit multi-annual &apos;Shiraka&apos; programme; Strengthening good governance and public financial management in the Middle East and North Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this tailor-made training (TMT) is to improve the knowledge, skills and capabilities of women working in the justice sector by sharing knowledge, experiences and expertise on various topics. The training will have a positive impact on women&#x2019;s abilities and efficiency at work and it will increase their opportunities (to reach to decision making positions). Last but not least, the course also aims at strengthening participants&#x2019; ties with the Netherlands and the Dutch government.</narrative>
  </description>
